ion", "Heliod's Pilgrim", "Heliod's Punishment", 'Heliod, Sun-Crowned', 'Hero of the Games', 'Hero of the Nyxborn', 'Hero of the Pride', 'Hero of the Winds', 'Heroes of the Revel', "Hydra's Growth", 'Hyrax Tower Scout', 'Ichthyomorphosis', 'Idyllic Tutor', 'Ilysian Caryatid', 'Impending Doom', 'Incendiary Oracle', 'Indomitable Will', 'Inevitable End', 'Infuriate', 'Inspire Awe', "Iroas's Blessing", 'Ironscale Hydra', 'Irreverent Revelers', 'Island', "Karametra's Blessing", 'Kiora Bests the Sea God', "Klothys's Design", 'Klothys, God of Destiny', "Kroxa, Titan of Death's Hunger", 'Kunoros, Hound of Athreos', 'Labyrinth of Skophos', 'Lagonna-Band Storyteller', "Lampad of Death's Vigil", 'Leonin of the Lost Pride', 'Loathsome Chimera', 'Mantle of the Wolf', "Medomai's Prophecy", 'Memory Drain', 'Mindwrack Harpy', "Minion's Return", 'Mire Triton', "Mire's Grasp", 'Mirror Shield', 'Mischievous Chimera', "Mogis's Favor", 'Moss Viper', 'Mountain', 'Mystic Repeal', 'Nadir Kraken', 'Naiad of Hidden Coves', 'Nessian Boar', 'Nessian Hornbeetle', 'Nessian Wanderer', 'Nexus Wardens', 'Nightmare Shepherd', "Nylea's Forerunner", "Nylea's Huntmaster", "Nylea's Intervention", 'Nylea, Keen-Eyed', 'Nyx Herald', 'Nyx Lotus', 'Nyxbloom Ancient', 'Nyxborn Brute', 'Nyxborn Colossus', 'Nyxborn Courser', 'Nyxborn Marauder', 'Nyxborn Seaguard', 'Omen of the Dead', 'Omen of the Forge', 'Omen of the Hunt', 'Omen of the Sea', 'Omen of the Sun', 'One with the Stars', "Oread of Mountain's Blaze", 'Ox of Agonas', 'Phalanx Tactics', "Pharika's Libation", "Pharika's Spawn", 'Pheres-Band Brawler', 'Phoenix of Ash', 'Pious Wayfarer', 'Plains', 'Plummet', 'Polukranos, Unchained', 'Portent of Betrayal', 'Protean Thaumaturge', "Purphoros's Intervention", 'Purphoros, Bronze-Blooded', 'Rage-Scarred Berserker', 'Relentless Pursuit', 'Renata, Called to the Hunt', 'Return to Nature', 'Reverent Hoplite', 'Revoke Existence', 'Riptide Turtle', 'Rise to Glory', 'Rumbling Sentry', 'Sage of Mysteries', "Satyr's Cun